{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22373","headline":"送兄弟回雪夜 · 白居易","name":"送兄弟回雪夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日晦云气黄，东北风切切。\n时从村南还，新与兄弟别。\n离襟泪犹湿，回马嘶未歇。\n欲归一室坐，天阴多无月。\n夜长火消尽，岁暮雨凝结。\n寂莫满炉灰，飘零上阶雪。\n对雪画寒灰，残灯明复灭。\n灰死如我心，雪白如我发。\n所隅皆如此，顷刻堪愁绝。\n回念入坐忘，转忧作禅悦。\n平生洗心法，正爲今宵设。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}